<title>GERMANY: Wayss says Q1 construction output up.</title>
<headline>Wayss says Q1 construction output up.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First three months of 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output		656     up 20 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    572     up 25 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German construction group is Wayss &amp; Freytag AG, which is majority-owned by Dutch builder Hollandsche Beton Groep NV.</p>
<p>Wayss also said in a statement it expected construction output for 1997 to total 3.12 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
